  "description": "The UI-free engine behind DiagramStudio: a dependency-light core for node-link and swimlane diagrams. Document model (shapes, links, lanes, auto-resizing containers, shape data) with versioned JSON persistence; a backend-neutral scene renderer; orthogonal/straight/Bezier connectors plus obstacle-avoiding routing; layered (Sugiyama), tree, radial, force-directed, circular, grid and lane-aware layouts; graph analysis (topological order, cycles, shortest path, components); and clean-room GraphViz DOT + Microsoft Visio .vsdx read/write interop built on the in-box System.IO.Packaging. No WPF, no commercial dependencies.",
